        1603,
        1467,
        1750
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the New York City Office of Emergency Management (\"OEM\"), in coordination with governmental and non-governmental stakeholders having an interest in reducing the impact of natural hazards throughout the City and with input from the private sector and other members of the public, has updated the Hazard Mitigation Plan for the City of New York, and",
